cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the paper below."
title: "Unified Places2 inpainting benchmark (code, configurations and per-image scores)"
type: software
version: "v1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mohamed-Abokhalil/natural-inpainting-benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/Mohamed-Abokhalil/natural-inpainting-benchmark"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24152118"
abstract: >-
  Code, configurations, test-set definition (Places365-Standard image list, QD-IMD masks, image-mask pairings, seeds)
  and per-image scores of the unified benchmark of 24 natural-image inpainting methods in "From Convolutions to
  Diffusion: A Decade of Deep Learning for Natural Image Inpainting". The generated outputs are archived in a separate
  Zenodo record (see zenodo_record.json).
keywords:
  - image inpainting
  - image completion
  - benchmark
  - Places2
  - deep learning
  - generative models
  - diffusion models
  - evaluation
